==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**6 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**6 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**6 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Don't be too hasty, the enemies are significantly more powerful than in previous chapters, even so, it is a manageable level with a good strategy.

